# Files Fern must not modify or delete when regenerating this repo.
#
# Fern owns the SDK source and its ci.yml; these are the hand-written release paths.
# publish-main.yml publishes @whop/sdk on a manual dispatch with an explicit version;
# publish-alpha.yml publishes whop-sdk-alpha on every push to the alpha branch. The
# Stainless machinery that used to be listed here (release-please, publish-npm.yml,
# bin/, scripts/publish-packages.ts) was deleted in the cutover, so it no longer needs
# protecting. scripts/rename-to-esm-files.js is Fern's own and is not listed.
.github/workflows/publish-main.yml
.github/workflows/publish-alpha.yml
